<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-66847" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title">  Jayce Savage
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember32167196" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>OK so I love the idea of texting or calling with multiple friends but the thing that is not necessary is that it is way too difficult to use I’ve tried a lot of different ways and it took me almost 100 times to find out how it works and I barely still not know how it works so can you please fix it? —BTW I just read through the texts and I just want to edit this as somebody who is talking about their grandfather dying and that house party save them I love that story but your response was that so heartwarming I love the first part where you said it was heartwarming but then after you said how do we get it to five stars I find this very rude very rude please do not do that!?? P.S. I gave this app 4 stars but because of your response in such a rude way I gave it 2 stars instead! ??</p>

  


<!----></blockquote>

