958","attributes":{"buyParams":"productType=A\u0026price=369990\u0026salableAdamId=1101003999\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default","name":"12000 Golds","offerType":{"offerType":"buy","accompaniesNoun":true},"price":"AED 369.99"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"product/app/in-app","id":"st32166959","attributes":{"buyParams":"productType=A\u0026price=1499990\u0026salableAdamId=1205406797\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default","name":"50000 Golds","offerType":{"offerType":"buy","accompaniesNoun":true},"price":"AED 1,499.99"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st28769","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Entertainment","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6016"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st28756","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Social Networking","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6005"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st28778","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Lifestyle","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6012"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st429375","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Photo \u0026 Video","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6008"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st28762","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Education","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6017"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st52998","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Books","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6018"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st28750","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Utilities","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6002"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st52990","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Family","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id7009"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st53004","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Simulation","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id7015"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"genre","id":"st52985","attributes":{"mediaType":"8","name":"Games","url":"https://itunes.apple.com/ae/genre/id6014"},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st32166960","attributes":{"body":"so basically the way it works is that the app is kind of like a house. when you open the app its like when you ring the bell or knock on the front door. it lets all your friends know that you’re in the house. so then you can wait for your friends to invite you to their rooms or wave at your friends to ask them to come into a room with you. after you have your friends gathered, you can lock the room so other people don’t come in. so yeah, it’s really fun bc you don’t need to call your friends individually, you can just talk to whoever is available. we have also had “lock wars” where two people fight to keep the room locked or unlocked, and we’ve invaded our friend’s rooms. \u003e😃 but other than that you can just chill with your friends and talk as if you were in a normal call.","date":"2019-06-06T15:00:21Z","name":"Lillymae Jeune","rating":5,"title":"Deleting messages !","userReviewId":"4273031710","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st32166961","attributes":{"body":"OK so I love the idea of texting or calling with multiple friends but the thing that is not necessary is that it is way too difficult to use I’ve tried a lot of different ways and it took me almost 100 times to find out how it works and I barely still not know how it works so can you please fix it? —BTW I just read through the texts and I just want to edit this as somebody who is talking about their grandfather dying and that house party save them I love that story but your response was that so heartwarming I love the first part where you said it was heartwarming but then after you said how do we get it to five stars I find this very rude very rude please do not do that!?? P.S. I gave this app 4 stars but because of your response in such a rude way I gave it 2 stars instead! ??","date":"2019-06-07T07:00:24Z","name":"Malekhi Scrane","rating":5,"title":"Jayce Savage","userReviewId":"4276353764","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st32166962","attributes":{"body":"The app was amazing when first download and updated multiple times, but it keeps kicking me and the people I talk to out of the entire app, it freezes, it lags a lot and it’s not the internet provider, because that has been checked by all the parties, if the phone it’s connected to chromecast, the app goes mute, if I leave the app to go to another app it doesn’t say “Paused”, it usually goes black or says “Low Connection. It kills the battery on the phone very rapidly, when using ghost mode on anyone like setting shows you, it still show others that you’re on, and I realized it when ai tested it with friends. The app needs to be updated, because it’s an amazing app to use with multiple people at the same time, and the ringtones are very catchy.","date":"2019-06-07T09:25:34Z","name":"Cordin Meikle","rating":5,"title":"Refreshing change!","userReviewId":"4276879909","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st32166963","attributes":{"body":"I really love FaceTiming all of my friends at once, but I cannot do it on my own phone. When I am house partying on my phone other people can not hear me but I can hear them perfectly fine. I enabled everything except for the Facebook, I’ve uninstalled then reinstalled the app, and I restarted my phone. I even made a new account but it still won’t work! I highly recommend everyone to try the app because it is very safe and I am literally the only one having this problem. But if u could somehow fix this problem, then I would love this app forever and it would deserve a five star review. Sorry for the long review but I really want this fixed. In return it will be five stars ??","date":"2019-06-07T12:55:34Z","name":"Gabrialla Grombridge","rating":5,"title":"Lights off?","userReviewId":"4277751062","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st32166964","attributes":{"body":"Friends did not answer ever and were asking for your location in school which was really sketchy I read it a two star because they want to know where you are and what school you go to which is really creepy  I don’t like that just knowing where you are and what school you go to just does not sound right to me why would you not wanna know where we are and what school you go to like that’s really creepy you should just like delete that people like that better just don’t be so creepy I don’t ask for stuff like that don’t mean it’s weird like. Why do you want to know where we are and when we are at school and are you store because I don’t like that it’s just not put girl in there","date":"2019-06-06T13:42:17Z","name":"Jariely Wickes","rating":5,"title":"Great!","userReviewId":"4272705600","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"lockup/app","id":"363590051","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["tvos","iphone","ipad","ipod"],"artistId":"363590054","artistName":"Netflix, Inc.","artistUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/ae/developer/netflix-inc/id363590054","kind":"iosSoftware","name":"Netflix","url":"https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/netflix/id363590051"},"relationships":{"offers":{"data":[{"type":"offer","id":"st9600"}]},"genres":{"data":[{"type":"genre","id":"st28769"},{"type":"genre","id":"st28778"}]},"artwork":{"data":{"type":"image","id":"st9601"}}}},{"type":"lockup/app","id":"425073498","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["ipad"],"artistId":"363433636","artistName":"Savage Interactive Pty Ltd","artistUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/ae/developer/savage-interactive-pty-ltd/id363433636","kind":"iosSoftware","name":"Procreate","url":"https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/procreate/id425073498"},"relationships":{"offers":{"data":[{"type":"offer","id":"st1867372"}]},"genres":{"data":[{"type":"genre","id":"st28769"},{"type":"genre","id":"st429375"}]},"artwork":{"data":{"type":"image","id":"st9614"}}}},{"type":"lockup/app","id":"505658864","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["iphone","ipad","ipod"],"artistId